~ validation
Guide: Yep. Valid. It's not you — the system is just genuinely confusing.
Guide: Most young people want help but get stuck at Step 0: "Umm... where do I even start?"
Guide: And honestly? A lot of people give up right there. Not because they don't want support, but because the path to get it feels like climbing a wall made of paperwork and question marks.
=> END